{
    "background_story": "Sage was a free-spirited surfer who lived for the thrill of riding the swell. Growing up by the ocean, he spent most of his days chasing waves and perfecting his craft. As he traveled the world in search of the ultimate ride, Sage developed a deep respect for the power and beauty of the sea. His friends would often describe him as being 'one with the wave,' able to anticipate and ride even the most unpredictable swells. Sage's passion for surfing wasn't just about the thrill; it was also about the sense of community and connection he felt with fellow surfers and the ocean itself. When a massive swell hit his hometown, Sage was the first to paddle out, his board slicing through the water as he rode the wave all the way to shore, his stoke infectious and inspiring to all who watched.",
